        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būpelanu bo Līshing'weng'we",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna shūbizako shiiloleelo shitaale ū ng'wigūlū, nkīma azwalile līīmi, al'ū kū sīlīlī, ū kū mhambala jakwe gwalīko ng'weji; lelo ū kū ntwe walī na ngikili ya sonda ikūmi n'ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo walī nda; kūhayimanīla wandya kūlījiwa būsūngū, nguno līkashika ī likanza lya kūbyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na shiiloleelo shingī shilonga ū ng'wigūlū, Līshing'weng'we lyaza itaale, lyalī na mitwe mpungatī na mapembe ikūmi; a ha mitwe yalyo jalīho ngikili mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīla gwalyo gūyooleleja selusi īmò ya Sonda ja ng'wigūlū, lyūjiponeja mu sī. Hūna ī lyoi ī Līshing'weng'we lyenīlo lyūng'wīmīīla ū kū būtongi bokwe ū nkīma ūyo walī hihī kūbyala, gīkī ūlū alabyale līnūmbūlīje kūngabbula ū Ng'wana wakwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbyala Ng'wana ngosha ūyo akūgadīīma pye a mahanga na nang'ha gwa chūma; haho na haho ū Ng'wana wakwe ng'wenūyo ūhwehulwa ūtwalwa kūlī Mulungu, kwī Isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū wei ū nkīma ūpeelela kwitogolo, ūūkikala kwipandī ilebe walī wabeegejiwa na Mulungu, gīkī banang'hane kwenūko ikanza lya shikū shihūmbī na magana abīlī na makūmi atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būkabūūka būlūgū ū ng'wigūlū, ū Mikaeli na a bamalaika bakwe būūlwa nalyo ī Līshing'weng'we; nalyo ī Līshing'weng'we lyūūlwa nabo, līlī na bamalaika balyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lītapyenile, nū wikalo wabo ū ng'wigūlū batabūpandīkile hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Līshing'weng'we ī litaale lyenīlo lyūponyiwa, ī Liyoka lya kale na kale, īlo līkitanagwa Lyanishi na Līshetani, Ilemba lembi lya sī ngima; lyūponejiwa mu sī hamò na a bamalaika balyo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna niigwa ilaka itaale ū ng'wigūlū līlīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Līshing'weng'we aho lyabona gīkī lyaponyiwa mu sī lyūng'wihuutīīla ū nkīma ūyo akabyala Ng'wana ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nkīma ng'wenūyo winhwa manana abīlī ga mbeshi nhaale, ūlala ajile kwipandī lyakwe kwitogolo, kūjūlishiwa ikanza na makanza na nusu y'ikanza, alyīngīle ī Liyoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalyo ī Liyoka lyūswa minzī kūfuma mu nomo gwalyo; gūbiza gītī mongo ū kū numa yakwe ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, gīkī apulwe līmongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī sī nayo yūngunanha ū nkīma, nguno īkatandūka yūlekana, yūgūmila ū mongo ūyo līkagūswa ī liyoka kūfuma mu nomo gwalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalīpelanya no ū nkīma ī Līshing'weng'we lyenīlo, lyūbūūka lījile kwilwisha būlūgū na a baana bakwe abo bataalī balīho, abo bashidimile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu, nū būkaanīji bo ng'wa Yesu balī nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī Līshing'weng'we lyūja lyūkīmīīla ha maseni ga ha nyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
